*.snap
*.xz
*~
# .sddm-qt6-stage/sddm-qt6 is build-tools/build-sddm-qt6.sh's output: SDDM
# rebuilt against the KDE Neon Qt 6.11.1 SDK (the Neon apt sddm package
# itself is NOT Qt 6.11.1-linked - the binaries require the Qt_6.11
# versioned symbol, see notes/todo/20261009-build-and-publish-kde-dangerous.txt).
# That SDK chain is no longer part of the build pipeline, so the verified
# output is committed instead of gitignored, letting CI and fresh
# checkouts pack the snap without rebuilding it.
!.sddm-qt6-stage/
!.sddm-qt6-stage/**
